{"title":"Science scholarships","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page is for listing of <b>Science scholarships</b> that are not subject specific.  Links to scholarships by subject can be found below.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Science_scholarships\">Science scholarships</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Science scholarships\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>These large scholarships span fields of science broadly.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Intel_Science_Talent_Search\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intel Science Talent Search\">Intel Science Talent Search</a>.  One of the oldest and largest math and science scholarship programs. Intel STS winners receive scholarships of up to $100,000.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.sciserv.org/sts/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=International_Science_and_Engineering_Fair\" title=\"International Science and Engineering Fair\">International Science and Engineering Fair</a>. Another Intel-sponsored science and mathematics competition, arguably the most important such competition in the world. The 3 ISEF winners each receive a &lt;dollar/&gt;50,000 scholarship. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external autonumber\" href=\"http://www.sciserv.org/isef\">[1]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Micron_Science_and_Technology_Scholars&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Micron Science and Technology Scholars (page does not exist)\">Micron Science and Technology Scholars</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.micron.com/students/scholarships/\">Website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Siemens_Competition_in_Math,_Science_%26_Technology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Siemens Competition in Math, Science &amp; Technology\">Siemens Competition in Math, Science &amp; Technology</a>.  Hundreds of thousands of dollars in scholarships awarded annually. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.siemens-foundation.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Siemens_Award_for_Advanced_Placement\" title=\"Siemens Award for Advanced Placement\">Siemens Award for Advanced Placement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Department_of_Homeland_Security&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Department of Homeland Security (page does not exist)\">Department of Homeland Security</a> Scholarship and Fellowship Program.  Full tuition and stipend and internships for eligible students. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.orau.gov/dhsed/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=UNCF-MERK_Undergrad_Science_Research_Scholarship_Award&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"UNCF-MERK Undergrad Science Research Scholarship Award (page does not exist)\">UNCF-MERK Undergrad Science Research Scholarship Award</a> <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://umsi.uncf.org/ScholarshipsInternshipsFellowships/tabid/151/Default.aspx#Undergraduate\">website</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scholarships_by_subject\">Scholarships by subject</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Scholarships by subject\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_scholarships\" title=\"Biology scholarships\">Biology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chemistry_scholarships\" title=\"Chemistry scholarships\">Chemistry scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Computer_science_scholarships\" title=\"Computer science scholarships\">Computer science scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Earth_science_scholarships\" title=\"Earth science scholarships\">Earth science scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Engineering_scholarships\" title=\"Engineering scholarships\">Engineering scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_scholarships\" title=\"Mathematics scholarships\">Mathematics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Physics_scholarships\" title=\"Physics scholarships\">Physics scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technology_scholarships\" title=\"Technology scholarships\">Technology scholarships</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_scholarships&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_scholarships\" title=\"Academic scholarships\">Academic scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Science_books\" title=\"Science books\">Science books</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018104154\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,t